1": 0.2230769230769231, "y1": 0.09867909867909867}, {"text": "\u2014 Edmund de Waal, The Hare with Amber Eyes", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.11577311577311578, "x1": 0.5032967032967033, "y1": 0.128982128982129}, {"text": "\u2014 Vladimir Nabokov, Speak, Memory", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.14296814296814297, "x1": 0.4230769230769231, "y1": 0.1561771561771562}, {"text": "+ Film \u2014 George Clooney, Good Night, and Good Luck", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.19658119658119658, "x1": 0.5648351648351648, "y1": 0.2097902097902098}, {"text": "+ Media \u2014 Gillian Armstrong, Unfolding Florence", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.5252747252747253, "y1": 0.2634032634032634}, {"text": "+ Shakespearean Drama \u2014 William Shakespeare, King Henry IV, Part 1", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3045843045843046, "x1": 0.7087912087912088, "y1": 0.3177933177933178}, {"text": "End of prescribed texts for Section IT", "x0": 0.34175824175824177, "y0": 0.8414918414918415, "x1": 0.6582417582417582, "y1": 0.8601398601398601}], [{"text": "Section III \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.11033411033411034, "x1": 0.2, "y1": 0.11965811965811966}, {"text": "Attempt parts (a) and (b) of Question 3 from Section IIT", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.12742812742812742, "x1": 0.6, "y1": 0.13986013986013987}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.15384615384615385, "x1": 0.45494505494505494, "y1": 0.16317016317016317}, {"text": "Answer the question in a writing booklet. Write your student number at the top of every", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.18026418026418026, "x1": 0.8285714285714286, "y1": 0.19347319347319347}, {"text": "booklet used. Extra writing booklets are available.", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.19658119658119658, "x1": 0.5241758241758242, "y1": 0.2097902097902098}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.22455322455322455, "x1": 0.5021978021978022, "y1": 0.23776223776223776}, {"text": "* craft language to address the demands of the question", "x0": 0.19230769230769232, "y0": 0.24475524475524477, "x1": 0.6494505494505495, "y1": 0.257964257964258}, {"text": "usi", "x0": 0.2164835164835165, "y0": 0.2595182595182595, "x1": 0.23186813186813188, "y1": 0.2812742812742813}, {"text": "language appropriate to audience, purpose and context to", "x0": 0.24835164835164836, "y0": 0.2641802641802642, "x1": 0.7065934065934066, "y1": 0.2773892773892774}, {"text": "ieliberately shape meaning", "x0": 0.22527472527472528, "y0": 0.2812742812742813, "x1": 0.4351648351648352, "y1": 0.29448329448329447}, {"text": "Question 3 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.32944832944832947, "x1": 0.3054945054945055, "y1": 0.3418803418803419}, {"text": "\u201cA person\u2019s character contributes to their beauty. It fortifies a person as their youth fades.", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.6565656565656566, "x1": 0.8604395604395605, "y1": 0.6697746697746698}, {"text": "Their conduct, courage, discipline, fortitude, and integrity can do a great deal to make a", "x0": 0.14505494505494507, "y0": 0.6744366744366744, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.6876456876456877}, {"text": "person beautifial.\u201d", "x0": 0.42417582417582417, "y0": 0.6915306915306916, "x1": 0.5736263736263736, "y1": 0.7047397047397047}, {"text": "(a) Considering the image and quote together, compose an imaginative response that", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.7451437451437452, "x1": 0.8340659340659341, "y1": 0.7583527583527584}, {"text": "paints an evocative image of a memorable character 12", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.7599067599067599, "x1": 0.8648351648351649, "y1": 0.7793317793317793}, {"text": "(b) Reflect on how you have used language in part (a) to create an evocative image and", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.8166278166278166, "x1": 0.8549450549450549, "y1": 0.8298368298368298}, {"text": "how ONE prescribed text from Module C inspired the way you crafted your", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.8344988344988346, "x1": 0.7934065934065934, "y1": 0.8477078477078477}, {"text": "memorable character. 8", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.8515928515928516, "x1": 0.8549450549450549, "y1": 0.8616938616938616}, {"text": "The prescribed texts for Module C are listed on page 8.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.8865578865578866, "x1": 0.6241758241758242, "y1": 0.8997668997668997}], [{"text": "Question 3 (continued)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.3054945054945055, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.11577311577311578, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.128982128982129}, {"text": "\u00a9 Prose Fiction", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.1717171717171717, "x1": 0.2934065934065934, "y1": 0.18104118104118105}, {"text": "~Kate Chopin, The Awakening", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.19735819735819735, "x1": 0.37362637362637363, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "\u2014 Elizabeth Harrower, The Fun of the Fair", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.22455322455322455, "x1": 0.46373626373626375, "y1": 0.23776223776223776}, {"text": "~ Franz Kafka, Metamorphosis", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.2517482517482518, "x1": 0.37142857142857144, "y1": 0.26495726495726496}, {"text": "\u2014Nam Le, Love and Honour and Pity and Pride and Compassion and Sacrifice", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.27816627816627815, "x1": 0.7626373626373626, "y1": 0.2913752913752914}, {"text": "\u2014 Colum McCann, Thirteen Ways of Looking", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.30536130536130535, "x1": 0.4846153846153846, "y1": 0.3185703185703186}, {"text": "McCann, What Time Is It Now, Where You Are?", "x0": 0.1967032967032967, "y0": 0.33255633255633255,